{"t":"SWKS","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":10000,"hq":"Irvine, CA, United States","website":"https://www.skyworksinc.com","summary_en":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and markets analog and mixed-signal semiconductor products and solutions in the United States, Taiwan, China, South Korea, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company offers amplifiers, antenna tuners, attenuators, automotive tuners and digital radios, wireless ASoC, DC/DC converters, demodulators, detectors, digital power isolators, diodes, directional couplers, diversity receive modules, filters, front-end modules, hybrids, light emitting diode drivers, low noise amplifiers, mixers, modulators, and optocouplers/optoisolators. It also provides phase locked loops, phase shifters, power dividers/combiners, power over ethernet, power isolators, ProSLIC family of subscriber line interface circuits, receivers, system in package, switches, synthesizers, timing devices, voltage-controlled oscillators/synthesizers, and voltage regulators. The company sells its products through direct sales force, electronic component distributors, and independent sales representatives. Its products are used in aerospace, automotive, broadband, cellular infrastructure, connected home, defense, entertainment and gaming, industrial, medical, smartphone, tablet, and wearables applications. The company was founded in 1962 and is headquartered in Irvine, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 대만, 중국, 한국, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역에서 아날로그 및 혼합 신호 반도체 제품과 솔루션을 개발, 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 증폭기, 안테나 튜너, 감쇠기, 자동차 튜너 및 디지털 라디오, 무선 ASoC, DC/DC 변환기, 복조기, 감지기, 디지털 전력 절연기, 다이오드, 방향성 커플러, 다이버시티 수신 모듈, 필터, 프런트 엔드 모듈, 하이브리드, 발광 다이오드 드라이버, 저잡음 증폭기, 믹서, 변조기 및 광커플러/광절연기를 제공합니다. 또한 위상 고정 루프, 위상 시프터, 전력 분배기/결합기, 이더넷을 통한 전력 공급, 전력 절연기, ProSLIC 가입자 회선 인터페이스 회로 제품군, 수신기, 시스템 인 패키지, 스위치, 합성기, 타이밍 장치, 전압 제어 발진기/합성기 및 전압 조정기를 제공합니다. 회사는 직접 판매원, 전자부품 유통업체, 독립 판매 대리점을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. 해당 제품은 항공우주, 자동차, 광대역, 셀룰러 인프라, 커넥티드 홈, 국방, 엔터테인먼트 및 게임, 산업, 의료, 스마트폰, 태블릿 및 웨어러블 애플리케이션에 사용됩니다. 이 회사는 1962년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 어바인에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":80.605,"mcap":18930458624.0,"pe":70.70615,"fpe":10.687172,"peg":0.4096,"ps":4.7809014,"pb":2.1026478,"ev_ebitda":21.849,"div":0.0,"beta":1.493,"hi52":93.24,"lo52":51.93},"fin":{"rev":3959600128.0,"rev_g":-0.05,"eps_g":-0.841,"gross":0.40784,"op":0.107489996,"net":0.04346,"roe":0.03,"fcf":307487488.0,"cash":2606099968.0,"debt":2651200000.0,"de":46.385,"eps":1.14,"feps":7.54222},"own":{"short":0.13430001,"inst":0.79809,"insider":0.00418},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":79.11111,"median":78.0,"high":107.0,"low":58.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.04,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":20,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":2,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":20,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":20,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":77.0,"priorPriceTarget":65.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":79.0,"priorPriceTarget":70.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":79.0,"priorPriceTarget":90.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":75.0,"priorPriceTarget":65.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","Fro